                    File, Country File, Vietnam, Memos to the President/Bombing Halt Decision, Vol.
                    V. Secret; HARVAN Double Plus. A handwritten
                    notation on the memorandum reads: “Put on desk.”</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d204-f2" n="2" xml:id="d204-f2-content">
                <p>The meeting, which began at 11:25 a.m. and lasted until 12:25 a.m., also included
                    Read. (Ibid., Dean Rusk Appointment Books,
                    1968-1969) No other record of the meeting has been found.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d204-f3" n="3" xml:id="d204-f3-content">
                <p>For the message to Thieu, see <ref
                        target="#d206">Document 206</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
